   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Femina HIP II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till ungdomstidning som ges ut i Tanzania, tar upp ungdomars hela livssituation, med fokus p&#xe5; Hiv/Aids. En del av projektet g&#xe5;r ut p&#xe5; att utveckla en metod f&#xf6;r kommunikation med ungdomar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for a Youth Magazine, distributed in Tanzania, dealing with young peeople and healthy lifestyles, with a special focus on HIV/AIDS. One part of the prject is about developing a method for communication with youth.</narrative>
  </description>
